mbinethepromisingclass/pointvariantwithlinearizedcoupling. Builtwhilefreshround4benchmarkactive,notyettested.\n\nFreshround4 isolated8roundmedians:241 .0477952;244 .0502961;247coreset80 .0564291;248classmeanskip3 .0456333;249meanlastcolumnhard16 .0447408;253linearcolumn .0450466;254linearboth .0442811;257unitmeancontrol .0486130;260torchindexselect .0479098;261globallabel .0478408. Onlymodestgainssurvivefresh-processcheck;coresetsrejectforspeed. Last262-265combinationsscreeningbeforechoosingfinalofficialcandidate. Exactmeasuredbest241unchangedandnoofficialevalpending.\n\n262-265 all30 local valid; max nRMSE262 .00360075,263 .00464993,264 .00358652,265 .00788924. Fresh round5 medians241 .0441859;249 .0435620;254 .0444583;262 .0424352;263 .0413659;264 .0413984;265 .0400741.265 fastest combines class mean, third coarse point update omission, label take and linearized second coupling column balancing. Select265 for complete official. Current265 temporary; best241 available.264 lower-error alternative will also benefit from complete comparison if265 valid. No concurrent numerical work during official evaluation.\n\n265 complete official {\"status\": \"ok\", \"raw_metric\": 0.04625840150013876, \"score\": 0.9112964935233014, \"quality_valid\": true, \"method_sha256\": \"cbb503193aabdeefdcb35fa0d64660e7ed23e9237f69481998f6c2c3ca1dbece\", \"result_path\": \"/opt/public_eval/results/7be8583bab7b4875bd03646ff3ef5f7d.json\"}. All30 valid, new best raw0.04625840150013876(score0.9112964935233014), exact hashcbb503193aabdeefdcb35fa0d64660e7ed23e9237f69481998f6c2c3ca1dbece. Report copied unchanged.265 currently remains best; next evaluate264lowererroralternative.\n\n264 complete official {\"status\": \"ok\", \"raw_metric\": 0.0488753250654554, \"score\": 0.9062783716492805, \"quality_valid\": true, \"method_sha256\": \"530ce257edf08b325935c8d67349714134490d5e92d12f438f63a6528f41a725\", \"result_path\": \"/opt/public_eval/results/2d001ba35d8b43e1a88651e3b4a4a8f0.json\"}. All30 valid but raw0.0488753251 slower than2650.0462584015. Report preserved unchanged. Restore best265 and finish source/launcher hash verification, final profile, cleanup and continuing notes.\n\nFinal best265 restored with exact evaluator source hash verified. Frozen launcher hash unchanged. All30 cases and270 quality records valid. Submission files are exactly method.py and solve.sh; own generated cache removed. Environment-owned workspace directories untouched. Final profile and complete continuing notes saved. Six complete official runs,94 source snapshots,93 all-case local screens,78 locally valid variants. No evaluation pending.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
