ert needle in s;s=s.replace(needle,repl)\n save(f'{k}_class_cumulant{degree}_{steps}',s)\n# Top1 optimized extraction and sparse switch later/earlier ablations.\ns=(root/'273_sparse_class_hard1/method.py').read_text()\ns=s.replace('''            ri=residual.topk(1,dim=2,largest=False,sorted=False).indices\n            ci=residual.topk(1,dim=1,largest=False,sorted=False).indices.transpose(1,2).contiguous()''','''            ri=residual.argmin(2)[:,:,None]\n            ci=residual.argmin(1)[:,:,None]''')\nsave('289_sparse_class_argmin',s)\nfor k,cut in [(290,32),(291,2)]:\n save(f'{k}_sparse_class_argmin{cut}',s.replace('float(eps.max())<=8.',f'float(eps.max())<={cut}.'))\nPY\npython /tmp/research_history/build_episode6_more.py\ncat >> /tmp/research_history/episode_6_working_notes.md <<'TXT'\n\n266 start-source265 repeat complete official: raw0.05008928056631703, score0.9039505326807684, all30 quality-valid, exact hashcbb503193aabdeefdcb35fa0d64660e7ed23e9237f69481998f6c2c3ca1dbece. Original report copied unchanged. Current best historical265 raw0.0462584. Diagnostic profile0.05969s, class0.022, point0.020, coupling0.007. Started local all30 screen267-278 after evaluator finished; no concurrent timings.\n\n277 fully segmented class solver sorts supports then uses a single unpadded empirical cost matrix plus NumPy reduceat, exact class-specific annealing and stable soft-transform fallback. 278 uses100 cropped NumPy matrices only after late hard switch. Both preserve original geometry and finite class schedule. Prepared during266, not run until266 complete.\n\n279-282 isolate earlier class hard transforms32/64/128/256 with current class/point mean initializations and skip3 point schedule. 283/284 omit one/two additional coarse class updates. 285-288 replace first1/2 class updates by degree1/2/3 residual-cost cumulants. 289-291 extract top1 sparse class neighbors with argmin instead of topk, compare hard thresholds8/32/2. Sources saved while first local screens running; 