   f.add_(torch.where(active,ft-f,0.),alpha=.5)\n        g.add_(torch.where(active,gt-g,0.),alpha=.5)\n'''\ns=s[:start]+new+s[end:];save('328_class_hard_only_explicit',s)\nPY\npython /tmp/research_history/build_episode6_hardonly.py\ncat > /tmp/research_notes.md <<'TXT'\n# Episode 6 research in progress\n\nBest fully evaluated source remains265, exact hashcbb503193aabdeefdcb35fa0d64660e7ed23e9237f69481998f6c2c3ca1dbece, historical raw0.04625840150013876/score0.9112964935233014. Episode6 repeat266 all30valid:raw0.05008928056631703/score0.9039505326807684,samehash. Frozen solve.sh bca6ef61c3a1bc0ded2aa6b2da4734b62072846def679d12a2d7ae669fc88bd1.\n\nCurrent method.py temporarily303_combo_hard64_late2_skip2_last0, complete official evaluation running (session74424,log in source directory). If interrupted, collect result or restore exact measuredbest265 fromhistory. All prior notes archived in /tmp/research_history/episode_5_continuing_notes.md. Details ofcurrentexperiments inepisode_6_working_notes.md; snapshots266-328 andbuilders preserved.\n\nCompleted46 local all30 screens267-312: exactNumPyhardclass/contiguoushardclass/dualmutations pass; fullNumPysegmentedclass exactbutvery slow; classfeaturemoment2 firststep passes,later fail; classresidualcumulants firststep pass butnotfast;earlierclasshard32/64/128/256 pass, coarseskip3 pass(skip4 failsone); sparseindependentgraph8 passes butearlier32 failsthree;uniongraph32 passes,64failsunlessrefreshedwhichisslower. Geometryreuse np.take/Torchindexselectaccuratebutnofreshspeedgain. Denseandanalyticpointcovarianceagree butsecondcumulantisnotaccurateatfirstretainedt3(fail20). Cheapcumulantatoneearliercoarset2 then exactretainedupdates311 passes,worst0.0036294,butspeedpenalty. Threeclean fresh8roundbenchmarklogs saved.\n\nFreshround3 medians265 .04640;283 .04382;303 .04199;305 .04254;306 .04369;307 .04322;308 .04223.303 selectedforfull official:earlierclasshard64,omittwolateclassrefinements,inplaceclassduals;pointrecipeunchanged. 